# Guild security adapter (optional — demo / local-demo is default)
# Never commit real tokens. Never set NEXT_PUBLIC_* for secrets.
# Copy to `.env.local` (web) and/or root `.env` — both are gitignored.
#
# GUILD_SECURITY_MODE=demo
# GUILD_API_TOKEN=glda_your_token_here
# GUILD_API_KEY=glda_your_token_here
# GUILD_ENTITY_ID=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
# GUILD_WORKSPACE_ID=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
#
# Even with credentials present, createAdapter() stays on DemoGuildAdapter
# (source: "local-demo") until a real Guild policy-evaluation SDK/API is wired.
# Credentials are stored for future Guild CLI / API calls only — not live enforcement.
